        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.733,
            0.82,
            0.788
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In the network above, if we decided not to include G in our network, but still wanted to model the joint distribution of all the other variables, what is the smallest network structure we could use?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.492,
            0.874,
