          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9 True and False"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.201,
            0.194,
            0.818,
            0.23
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. It is sometimes worth paying for a test even if you will choose the same alternative no matter what the test results are."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.243,
            0.818,
            0.279
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. A person for whom it is rational to play the lottery has a convex utility function."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.292,
            0.818,
            0.329
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. If a dataset of dimension n is not linearly separable, it can be made linearly separable by adding extra features."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.201,
            0.341,
            0.818,
            0.378
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. A network of perceptrons with step-function outputs induces a linear separator."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.201,
            0.39,
            0.601,
            0.408
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. Inference in first-order logic is NP-complete."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.42,
            0.739,
            0.439
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. A logical sentence is valid if it is true in some interpretation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.201,
            0.452,
            0.818,
            0.487
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. Iterative deepening search requires time exponential in the depth of the solution."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.201,
            0.5,
            0.82,
            0.536
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8. Iterative deepening search requires space exponential in the depth of the solution."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 9,
